[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="WeaponStats" load_steps=2 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/WeaponStats.gd" id="1"]

; The shield (issue #275). A broad plate on a short haft. It does little damage
; by itself, but Player.gd (under `special = &"shield"`) makes a hit that lands
; on the side the shield faces mostly bounce off, and a bash with it shoves
; whoever it hits hard. Blocking and bashing are the whole weapon.
;
; The head is a 50 px wide heater shield (#465; it was 36): flat back, pointed
; tip. `head_polygon` is its real collision; the circles are the disabled
; sweep proxy. Head-local space as every other weapon's, +X along the haft.

[resource]
